## Project Structure Guide

- App is a React SPA using Tailwind, Radix UI, Zustand, React Query (TanStack Query), and Supabase.
- Uses a **feature-based folder structure** for scalability and maintainability.

### Top-Level Structure

```
src/
├── app/                    # App-level setup (router, layouts)
├── features/               # Feature modules (auth, pomodoro, journals, etc.)
├── shared/                 # Shared code (ui components, utils, constants)
├── assets/                 # Static assets (icons, images, sounds)
├── styles/                 # Global styles
└── index.jsx               # App entry point (QueryClientProvider + Router)
```

### Feature Modules

Each feature in `features/` follows a consistent structure:

```
features/[feature-name]/
├── services/          # Data layer (migrated features)
│   ├── apis/          #   Raw Supabase calls + transformers
│   ├── mutations/     #   useMutation hooks (write operations)
│   └── queries/       #   useQuery hooks (read operations)
├── components/        # UI components for this feature
├── constants/         # Constants specific to this feature
├── hooks/             # Custom hooks (if any)
├── pages/             # Route pages
├── store/             # Zustand store — UI/selection state only
├── types/             # TypeScript types
├── utils/             # Utilities (transformers, validators)
└── index.js           # Feature exports
```

> **Note:** `auth` still uses the legacy `api/` folder since it handles session/identity flows rather than table CRUD.

### Key Entry Points

- **App Entry**: [src/index.jsx](mdc:src/index.jsx) — QueryClient setup, QueryClientProvider, ReactQueryDevtools
- **Router**: [src/app/router/index.jsx](mdc:src/app/router/index.jsx)
- **Layouts**: [src/app/layouts/](mdc:src/app/layouts/)
- **Layout Components**: [src/app/layouts/components/](mdc:src/app/layouts/components/) - Header, Footer, Sidebar

### Features

- **Auth**: [src/features/auth/](mdc:src/features/auth/) - Login, signup, OTP, password management (legacy `api/`)
- **Pomodoro**: [src/features/pomodoro/](mdc:src/features/pomodoro/) - Timer, tasks, sessions (`services/`)
- **Journals**: [src/features/journals/](mdc:src/features/journals/) - Journal entries (`services/`)
- **Dashboard**: [src/features/dashboard/](mdc:src/features/dashboard/) - Overview widgets (consumes queries from other features)
- **Settings**: [src/features/settings/](mdc:src/features/settings/) - User settings (`services/`)
- **Home**: [src/features/home/](mdc:src/features/home/) - Landing page
- **Analytics**: [src/features/analytics/](mdc:src/features/analytics/) - Analytics (placeholder)

### Shared Code

- **UI Components**: [src/shared/ui/](mdc:src/shared/ui/) - Radix/Shadcn primitives
- **Constants**: [src/shared/constants/](mdc:src/shared/constants/) - routes.js, global.js, queryKeys.ts
- **Utils**: [src/shared/utils/](mdc:src/shared/utils/) - date.js, jsUtils.js (upsertById, deleteById, debounce)
- **Transformers**: [src/shared/transformers/](mdc:src/shared/transformers/) - common.js
- **Supabase**: [src/shared/supabase/](mdc:src/shared/supabase/) - Client initialization, table names
- **Lib**: [src/shared/lib/](mdc:src/shared/lib/) - cn() utility, api.js (parseApiResponse, ApiError)
- **Hooks**: [src/shared/hooks/](mdc:src/shared/hooks/) - useTabTitle

### Import Aliases

- `@/*` - maps to `src/*`
- Use `@/features/[feature]` for feature imports
- Use `@/shared/` for shared code imports
- Use `@/app/` for app-level imports
